      "id": "doc_1792478457854_stdcs",
      "title": "Sprint Retrospective",
      "content": "<h1>Sprint Retrospective</h1><p><strong>Sprint:</strong> 24 &nbsp;|&nbsp; <strong>Facilitator:</strong> Team Lead</p><hr><h2>🟢 What Went Well</h2><ul><li><p>Fast delivery speed using modern full-stack patterns.</p></li><li><p>Clean separation of UI, API handlers, and data persistence.</p></li></ul><h2>🟡 What Could Be Improved</h2><ul><li><p>Add real-time websocket presence cursors in the next iteration.</p></li></ul><h2>🎯 Action Items</h2><ol><li><p>Polish README and deployment steps.</p></li></ol>",
