    {
      "id": "doc_1792478454654_nbm4h",
      "title": "Product Requirement Doc (PRD)",
      "content": "<h1>PRD: Next-Generation Collaborative Editor</h1><p><strong>Author:</strong> Product Team &nbsp;|&nbsp; <strong>Target Quarter:</strong> Q4</p><hr><h2>1. Problem Statement</h2><p>Distributed product teams struggle with document fragmentation and complex permission management across multiple tools.</p><h2>2. User Stories</h2><ul><li><p><strong>As a writer</strong>, I want rich text formatting with zero lag so I can capture ideas effortlessly.</p></li><li><p><strong>As an owner</strong>, I want to control who can edit versus view my sensitive documents.</p></li><li><p><strong>As a reviewer</strong>, I want to upload reference attachments directly alongside the doc.</p></li></ul><h2>3. Technical Architecture</h2><pre><code>// Client &lt;-&gt; Server Data Flow\nUI (TipTap) -&gt; Debounced Auto-Save -&gt; REST API -&gt; Atomic JSON/SQLite Persistence</code></pre>",
      "ownerId": "user_charlie",
      "createdAt": "2026-10-20T06:40:54.654Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-20T06:40:55.452Z",
      "wordCount": 100,
      "characterCount": 662,
      "shares": [],
      "attachments": [],
      "currentUserRole": "owner"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc_1792478427740_carhy",
      "title": "Weekly Team Sync",
      "content": "<h1>Weekly Team Sync</h1><p><strong>Date:</strong> 20/10/2026 &nbsp;|&nbsp; <strong>Attendees:</strong> Engineering &amp; Product</p><hr><h2>1. Agenda &amp; Updates</h2><ul><li><p>Ship collaborative document platform v1 milestone.</p></li><li><p>Review UX feedback on share access models.</p></li><li><p>Sprint planning and backlog prioritization.</p></li></ul><h2>2. Open Discussion &amp; Decisions</h2><blockquote><p>Decision: Standardize permissions into Owner, Editor, and Viewer tiers for maximum clarity.</p></blockquote><h2>3. Action Items</h2><ol><li><p>Finalize automated test coverage and documentation.</p></li><li><p>Verify file upload streaming endpoints.</p></li><li><p>Record 3-minute product walkthrough.</p></li></ol>",
