    {
      "id": "doc_3",
      "title": "⚡ System Architecture & API Contracts",
      "content": "<h1>System Architecture &amp; API Contracts</h1><p><strong>Owner:</strong> Charlie Davis &nbsp;|&nbsp; <strong>Confidentiality:</strong> Internal</p><hr><h2>1. Architectural Goals</h2><p>Ensure reliable persistence, sub-millisecond route responses, and predictable role-based permission verification across all API endpoints.</p><h2>2. Security &amp; Role Matrix</h2><ul><li><p><strong>Owner:</strong> Full read, write, rename, share management, and document deletion.</p></li><li><p><strong>Editor:</strong> Full read and write content updates. Cannot delete the document.</p></li><li><p><strong>Viewer:</strong> Strictly read-only access. Editor input controls are disabled.</p></li></ul>",
